# Line endings (261015-windows-support FR1.4, team.md Code Style): every text
# file is stored and checked out with LF, so `cargo fmt --check` and
# `prettier --check` give the same result on Windows as on macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.dmg binary
*.exe binary
